# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Ħruġ ikteb: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: ([''] tccompare: ['']), linja-ġdida.
